<%#
patra-final 5b (G58): override of administrate's password form partial.
The super-admin New User form was browser-autofilled with the logged-in
admin's saved credentials. `new-password` tells the browser this is an
account-creation field, and we never echo a server-side value.
%>

<div class="field-unit__label">
  <%= f.label field.attribute %>
</div>
<div class="field-unit__field">
  <%= f.password_field field.attribute, value: '', autocomplete: 'new-password' %>
</div>
